d body components. A minimum body height ensures visibility for doji candles.\n\n\nA bounding rectangle function now correctly defines the visible area. The system scans for the latest tick file, excluding auxiliary export files, first in the local directory and then on a specified drive. If a file is found, it's sorted by modification time to get the newest file.\n\nA menu bar and file menu were added to the main application window with an \"Open Ticks\" action. This action triggers a file dialog for selecting tick data files, using a keyboard shortcut and calling a defined function upon selection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":".venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -c \"import glob, os; files = [f for f in glob.glob('*.txt') if f not in ['candles.txt', 'high_prices.txt', 'low_prices.txt', 'close_prices.txt']]; files.sort(key=os.path.getmtime); print('Latest in folder:', files[-1] if files else 'None')\"","Cwd":"Y:\\SIGNAL","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking latest tick file in python","toolSummary":"Find latest tick file using python"}}]}
