{"step_index":321,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T17:01:32Z","thinking":"The target file was located quickly. The user's request appears to involve reading a file, likely from the application's directory, suggesting dynamic file selection or a file-picking mechanism within the program. The mention of \"свеже\" indicates that the user might have provided a recent file to read.\n\n\nLupa enables direct Lua-Python interaction via in-process execution, avoiding inter-process communication overhead. Python uses `LuaRuntime` to compile and call Lua code, receiving Lua tables seamlessly. The program automatically detects the newest tick file in the `Y:\\SIGNAL\\` directory, or falls back to `Y:\\`.\n\nA file selector with a \"Файл\" -> \"Открыть тики...\" menu option will be added, providing flexible file opening capabilities. Drawing each candle as a Qt widget is slow; `CandlestickItem` renders candles as a cached vector picture using `QPicture` for optimal performance. The X-axis displays data with continuous indices and labeled time values, eliminating gaps.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Создание компонента CandlestickItem для высокоскоростной отрисовки свечей через QPicture в pyqtgraph.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"\"\"\"\ncandlestick_item.py — Высокоскоростной графический элемент японских свечей для pyqtgraph.\nИспользует QPicture для запекания всех свечей в один векторный вызов отрисовки (60+ FPS).\n\"\"\"\n\nimport pyqtgraph as pg\nfrom PyQt6 import QtCore, QtGui\n\n\nclass CandlestickItem(pg.GraphicsObject):\n    \"\"\"\n    Кастомный графический элемент для быстрого рендеринга японских свечей.\n    data: список кортежей вида (x_index, open, close, low, high)\n    \"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, data=None):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.data = data or []\n        self.picture = QtGui.QPicture()\n        if self.data:\n            self.generate_picture()\n\n    def set_data(self, data):\n        \"\"\"Обновить данные свечей и перерисовать кэш.\"\"\"\n        self.data = data\n        self.generate_picture()\n        self.update()\n\n    def generate_picture(self):\n        \"\"\"Запекание всех свечей в QPicture.\"\"\"\n        self.picture = QtGui.QPicture()\n        p = QtGui.QPainter(self.picture)\n\n        # Цвета TradingView\n        bull_color = QtGui.QColor('#26a69a')  # Зеленый (бычья)\n        bear_color = QtGui.QColor('#ef5350')  # Красный (медвежья)\n\n        pen_bull = pg.mkPen(color=bull_color, width=1.5)\n        pen_bear = pg.mkPen(color=bear_color, width=1.5)\n        brush_bull = pg.mkBrush(bull_color)\n        brush_bear = pg.mkBrush(bear_color)\n\n        body_width = 0.35  # Половина ширины тела свечи\n\n        for item in self.data:\n            x, o, c, l, h = item\n\n            if c >= o:\n                p.setPen(pen_bull)\n                p.setBrush(brush_bull)\n            else:\n                p.setPen(pen_bear)\n                p.setBrush(brush_bear)\n\n            # 1. Фитиль свечи (вертикальная линия от Low до High)\n            p.drawLine(QtCore.QPointF(x, l), QtCore.QPointF(x, h))\n\n            # 2. Тело свечи (прямоугольник от Open до Close)\n            top = max(o, c)\n            bottom = min(o, c)\n            height = top - bottom\n\n            # Если свеча плоская (доджи, open == close), делаем минимальную высоту 1.0 пункт\n            if height < 0.5:\n                height = 1.0\n                bottom = o - 0.5\n\n            p.drawRect(QtCore.QRectF(x - body_width, bottom, body_width * 2, height))\n\n        p.end()\n\n    def paint(self, p, *args):\n        \"\"\"Мгновенная отрисовка готовой векторной картинки на холсте.\"\"\"\n        p.drawPicture(0, 0, self.picture)\n\n    def boundingRect(self):\n        \"\"\"Границы элемента для автоматического масштабирования графика.\"\"\"\n        return QtCore.QRectF(self.picture.boundingRect())\n","Description":"Создание candlestick_item.py с классом CandlestickItem","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"Y:\\SIGNAL\\candlestick_item.py","toolAction":"Creating candlestick_item.py","toolSummary":"Create candlestick_item.py for fast candle rendering"}}]}
